From: MrUnforsaken
Date: 2026-05-25
Subject: [PATCH 0002] Native ffmpeg camera preview + FPS selector

Replace browser getUserMedia with native ffmpeg capture to work around the WebKitGTK PipeWire DMA_DRM bug that causes black camera preview.
Add 3-speed FPS dropdown (3/15/30 FPS) in the amber info bar.
Add WebKit media settings.
Register camera commands and CameraState.

